#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:2
msgid ""
"Who sees what when they sign in, and why the sidebar differs between one "
"visitor and the next"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:4
msgid ""
"The sidebar is not the same for everyone who opens the site. Most of it "
"is: the overview and this guide are open to all. One entry depends on who"
" is asking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:8
msgid "The entry that comes and goes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:10
msgid ""
"The staff guide's entry is shown to staff accounts and hidden from "
"everyone else. An entry that is hidden is not greyed out or crossed "
"through: it is simply not there, so a visitor cannot tell it exists from "
"the sidebar alone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you know the address, you can still try it. What you get back is told "
"in :doc:`/staff-guide`, and what each of the three accounts gets is "
"tabled in :doc:`accounts`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:19
msgid "What stays the same"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/who-sees-what-when-they-sign-in-and-why-the-sidebar-differs.rst:21
msgid ""
"The pages of this guide read the same for every visitor, signed in or "
"not. The breadcrumbs, the search button, the previous and next links and "
"the *On this page* panel do not depend on who you are."
msgstr ""

